# T12 whole with what it shows: seen before (not filled) and after locate, w copy by copy after learn and after merge.
options workers 4 islands 2,2
tensor x f32 128 32 fill tile+1
tensor w f32 128 32 replicated
state Spread.seen
invoke Spread.locate on 0 4
state Spread.seen
invoke Spread.learn x w 4:u32 on 0 4
read w
control merge w
read w
